<view class="wrap" wx:if="{{campaign}}"><text class="title">{{campaign.title}}</text><view class="card"><text class="heading">{{campaign.subtitle}}</text><text class="rules">{{campaign.content}}</text><text class="muted">符合条件的卡券可领取至“卡券与仿真币”，当前暂不参与支付抵扣。邀请奖励仍待核验接口接入，不会因分享直接发币。</text><button wx:if="{{campaign.id==='welcome'||campaign.id==='first'}}" bindtap="claim" disabled="{{busy}}">领取至卡券包</button><button wx:if="{{campaign.action==='SHARE'}}" open-type="share">邀请好友</button><button wx:else bindtap="go">{{campaign.action==='ORDERS'?'查看我的订单':'去发布需求'}} ›</button></view></view><view wx:else class="wrap">活动已下线或正在加载</view>
